					"content": "關於那些藍色植物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701410202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701410202,
					"content": "#如果{F#妳}{M#你}有興趣的話，可以去<color=#00E1FFFF>「覆雪之路」</color>、<color=#00E1FFFF>「雪葬之都·近郊」</color>和<color=#00E1FFFF>「星熒洞窟」</color>附近看看。我記得那裡有很多那種藍色植物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "玉霞"
				}
			]
		},
		{
